  "description": "<p>This personalized doormat offers a unique touch to any classroom, featuring a composition notebook style that blends educational charm with practical functionality. Designed to create a welcoming atmosphere, this doormat can be customized with a teacher's name, making it a special addition to any learning environment. It serves as an engaging accent piece while helping to maintain cleanliness.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalizable with a teacher's name for a unique classroom touch.</li>\n<li>Made from soft, durable non-woven fabric with a non-slip rubber backing.</li>\n<li>Effectively dries wet feet and traps dirt, dust, and grime.</li>\n<li>Heat-resistant material ensures long-lasting use.</li>\n<li>Suitable for both indoor and outdoor settings.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Composition Notebook Style</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Classroom</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Washable; simply hose down or sponge clean with mild liquid soap. Avoid bleaching.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Hose down or sponge clean</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Drying</td>\n<td>Air dry</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile doormat is ideal for classrooms, entryways, and RVs, providing a welcoming accent that is both functional and stylish. Its durable construction makes it suitable for high-traffic areas, helping to keep floors clean in various settings.</p>",
